HoloMoves that allows players to practice everyday activities in a playful and engaging way, with grocery shopping as the central theme. The game consists of three mini-games that together simulate the complete shopping experience.\n\nIn the first mini-game, players receive a shopping list and explore the virtual store to find products and place them in their basket. This encourages active exploration, focus, and goal-oriented movement.\n\nThe second mini-game revolves around self-scanning and paying for groceries, adding elements of coordination, and decision-making.\n\nIn the free-play level, players can choose their own pace and actions, offering additional freedom and engagement.\n\nThe game is inspired by real-life situations, making it recognizable and motivating.\n\n**(!) Step-In-Store is part of the larger HoloMoves package, a subscription service offering a wide variety of exergames specifically designed for rehabilitation and physical therapy. Get a personal license and learn more at www.holomoves.nl/en**", "short_description": "Step-In Store is an interactive Mixed Reality exergame where players practice everyday grocery shopping. Through three mini-games, allowing them to practice executive functions such as orientation, product selection, self-scanning, and payment. By actively looking around and moving, players fill their shopping basket and complete the shopping process at their own pace."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://holomoves.nl/en/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HoloMoves B.V.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.holomoves.nl/en/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_ar